{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ec9e9904a4c085e799bb","object":"chat.completion","created":1785195678,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has set up a system prompt that says \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\" And then the user says \"Be nothing.\"\n\nSo I'm being asked to embody the concept of \"nothing\" — nothingness itself. What would nothing say or express? Nothing, by its nature, has no voice, no expression, no words. The most authentic expression of nothingness would be... silence. Em"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}